==English==
{{wikipedia}} [[Image:Ajedrez captura al paso del peon.png|frame|En passant in chess]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|[[en]] [[passant]]||in passing}}.

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# in [[passing]]; [[incidentally]]; [[by the way]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|chess|lang=en}} A [[move]] in which a [[pawn]] [[capture]]s an opposing pawn on the same [[rank]] immediately after the latter moved two [[squares]] from its initial position as if it had captured it while the latter was [[passing]] [[through]].{{attention|en|Someone please fix my wordiness.}}

